# Curated extensions to ENABLE for the gnome-extensions module (P6.3).
# Each line is one extension uuid (or its packaged .desktop id must not be
# here -- this file is only the enable set). Uuids are validated to
# [A-Za-z0-9._@-] and deduped first-seen by the shared list grammar.
# Only uuids already installed on the system are enabled: a uuid that is not
# installed is reported and skipped (install its distro package first via
# packages.<family>.list). Re-runs are no-ops for already-enabled uuids.
dash-to-dock@micxgx.gmail.com
user-theme@gnome-shell-extensions.gcampax.github.com
